-- This is the baseline migration script for Flyway.
-- Since the schema might be generated by Hibernate (ddl-auto=update) during initial development,
-- we set spring.flyway.baseline-on-migrate=true to mark the existing DB as baseline.
-- For a fresh production deployment, replace this file with the actual DDL export of your schema.
-- Example to generate: Add `spring.jpa.properties.javax.persistence.schema-generation.scripts.action=create` 
-- and `spring.jpa.properties.javax.persistence.schema-generation.scripts.create-target=create.sql` in application.properties.
